                                "sense_id": "0400fe02-186c-3918-877b-8115ba67f406",
                                "text": "They had spread themselves beneath the oaks and chestnuts and planted the green banks with tussocks of crocuses; it was more like some exercise in trichology than horticulture."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
